OL,3,GNEWSAFinucane calls Conservative MP's
OL,4,A'IRA lawyers' comments 'contemptible'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe son of murdered Belfast solicitor
OL,7,FPat Finucane has called on a
OL,8,FConservative MP to withdraw comments he
OL,9,Fmade about "IRA lawyers" during a
OL,10,Fdebate on legacy in the House of
OL,11,FCommons.
OL,13,FSinn Fein MP John Finucane described
OL,14,FSir David Davis' remarks as
OL,15,F"contemptible".
OL,17,FDuring a contribution to the debate on
OL,18,Fthe government's Troubles bill on
OL,19,FTuesday, Davis referred to "the
OL,20,Factivities of IRA lawyers in the
OL,21,Fcourts".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
