OL,3,GNEWSAFinucane calls Conservative MP's
OL,4,A'IRA lawyers' comments 'contemptible'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe went on to say "IRA lawyers" were
OL,7,F"more interested in drama than
OL,8,Fjustice", quoting a British soldier
OL,9,Finvolved in a legacy court case.
